I'll just buy everything they have here.

278
00:16:24,410 --> 00:16:25,410
All of it...

279
00:16:25,410 --> 00:16:27,210
Ugh, come on...

280
00:16:27,210 --> 00:16:29,010
Something like this?

281
00:16:29,010 --> 00:16:31,010
Put it here like this...

282
00:16:31,010 --> 00:16:32,010
Okay, okay, okay!

283
00:16:32,010 --> 00:16:40,970
This...

284
00:16:40,970 --> 00:16:41,770
Alright!

285
00:16:41,770 --> 00:16:49,360
Do I need liquids?

286
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:52,160
Liquids, like...

287
